# MikuNime APK — Full Security Assessment Report
# TARGET GRID: panel.mikunime.web.id
# APK: MikuNime v0.3.2
# Date: 2026-09-10

---

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

MikuNime is an anime streaming Android app with a Laravel backend. The APK contains
hardcoded HMAC signing secrets that allow forging valid API requests. Combined with
IDOR, mass assignment, Firebase Auth email enumeration, and notification injection,
an attacker can: read any user's profile/inventory, enumerate 16+ user emails,
impersonate the owner in chat, flood admin email with password resets, and inject
chat messages visible to all 50+ active users.

**Severity: HIGH** — Signing key extraction enables full API impersonation.
**CVSS: 8.1** (High) — Network/Low/None/Changed/High/None

